Package: scVeloR
Type: Package
Title: Fast RNA Velocity Analysis for Seurat and SingleCellExperiment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("scVeloR", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tsneland@gmail.com")
Description: RNA velocity analysis of single-cell data in R, powered by a
    multi-threaded Rust core. Implements the steady-state, stochastic and
    dynamical models of splicing kinetics, velocity graphs, embedding
    projections, streamlines, terminal states, velocity pseudotime and latent
    time, following the methods of scVelo (Bergen et al., 2020), with ggplot2
    figures. Works directly on 'Seurat' and 'SingleCellExperiment' objects and
    reads velocyto '.loom' files.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
